{"3109740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spirit of the Goddess", "steam_appid": 3109740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4874790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant, epic world where magic and adventure await around every corner! This enchanting RPG blends a charming, cartoony art style with thrilling gameplay, inviting you to explore dungeons, master powerful skills, and engage in fast-paced sword combat while following an engaging story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/b00026a7312c4627a5834d9ef0992b40.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/b00026a7312c4627a5834d9ef0992b40.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/b00026a7312c4627a5834d9ef0992b40.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/9804b051f4222131359ee13241f17f1e.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/9804b051f4222131359ee13241f17f1e.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/9804b051f4222131359ee13241f17f1e.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming World with a Cute Style: Immerse yourself in a beautifully stylized world where every character, creature, and environment bursts with personality and charm. The vibrant visuals and playful designs create a delightful backdrop for your epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/af1520770b2e890d1fc14882197c9a78.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/af1520770b2e890d1fc14882197c9a78.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/af1520770b2e890d1fc14882197c9a78.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills and Swordplay: Whether you're mastering skills, shooting arrows or swinging your sword, combat is fluid, fun, and filled with flashy effects. Mix and match your abilities with melee skills to defeat a variety of dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/71390c4d417e5ffd63011de216e843c6.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/71390c4d417e5ffd63011de216e843c6.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/71390c4d417e5ffd63011de216e843c6.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting dungeon: Venture into creatively designed dungeons brimming with puzzles, traps, and treasures. Each dungeon offers a unique challenge, from tricky platforming sections to brain-teasing riddles, all wrapped up in a whimsical package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/1c4a3c496fbca86dc9f5336090284a6e.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/1c4a3c496fbca86dc9f5336090284a6e.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/1c4a3c496fbca86dc9f5336090284a6e.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in cute or dangerous side quests, or a mix of both! From finding the corn to feed the farm animals to helping a grumpy wizard find his missing hat, the world is full of charming side quests that add depth and humor to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/47cbae408d405f51afc0674385216391.poster.avif?t=1782271025\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/47cbae408d405f51afc0674385216391.webm?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109740/extras/47cbae408d405f51afc0674385216391.mp4?t=1782271025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical adventure where cuteness meets chaos. Will you uncover the secrets of the dungeons, outsmart your foes, and become the hero of this enchanting world?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p clas